ode_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-02-04T13:02:34Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T14:46:09Z","closed_at":"2025-02-04T14:32:27Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nTested in 4.4beta2\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta2 - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6636) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-13700K (24 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using _validate_property to hide `@export_tool_button`, the button is not hidden in the inspector.\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _validate_property(property: Dictionary):\n\tif property.name == \"_action_button\":\n\t\tproperty.usage |= PROPERTY_USAGE_NONE\n```\n\nI tried using other types like PROPERTY_USAGE_READ_ONLY and they work.\nI was able to work around the issue by using PROPERTY_USAGE_HIGH_END_GFX to hide it but I don't think this would work in all cases, depending on the project.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nUse the following code:\n\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends Node2D\n\n@export_tool_button(\"Action\") var _action_button = action\n\nfunc action():\n\tprint(\"action pressed\")\n\nfunc _validate_property(property: Dictionary):\n\tif property.name == \"_action_button\":\n\t\tproperty.usage |= PROPERTY_USAGE_NONE\n```\n\n_action_button should not be displayed in the inspector but it is.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[hidetoolbutton.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18657418/hidetoolbutton.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"rethyria","id":128059044,"node_id":"U_kgDOB6IGpA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128059044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rethyria","html_url":"https://github.com/rethyria","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rethyria/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rethyria/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rethyria/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rethyria/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rethyria/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rethyria/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rethyria/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rethyria/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rethyria/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102408/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102408/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}